    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="i-down-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5l13 13M18 8v10H8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="i-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M7.6 12.4l3 3 5.8-6.2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
          <symbol id="i-up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 18L18 6M8 6h10v10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    </svg>

    <section class="hero hero-about hero-services hero-legal hero-case" aria-labelledby="case-title">
      <span class="hbar hbar-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-4" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <div class="ah-copy">
        <p class="ah-label" data-reveal>Case study</p>
        <h1 id="case-title" data-speakable>
          <span class="line">NICRO</span><span class="line">Industrial</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="ah-intro" data-reveal data-speakable>A website concept for an industrial materials supplier</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-index cs-meta" role="group" aria-label="Project details">
        <ol>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Type</span><span class="si-t">Website Concept</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Industry</span><span class="si-t">Industrial Materials / B2B</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Role</span><span class="si-t">Website Design &amp; Front-End Development</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Build</span><span class="si-t">Custom HTML, CSS &amp; JavaScript</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Motion</span><span class="si-t">GSAP &amp; Lenis</span></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark pj cs-open" id="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>Overview</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="overview-title">Making industrial materials easier to understand and explore.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>Industrial websites need to do more than look technical. They need to communicate what a company supplies, help buyers understand its capabilities, and make important information easy to find.</p><p data-rise>NICRO Industrial is a website concept built around that idea. The direction uses a strong industrial visual identity, structured content, and purposeful interactions to present high-nickel alloys and industrial materials in a more organized and accessible way.</p>
            <div class="pj-actions" data-rise><a class="cta cta-menu" href="https://nicro.systeme.io/nicroindustrialdemo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>View Live Concept</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-up-right"/></svg></a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="pj-shot cs-shot" style="--ar:16 / 9"><a class="pj-link" href="https://nicro.systeme.io/nicroindustrialdemo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="assets/img/project-nicro.webp" alt="Concept website for NICRO Industrial: the homepage headline reads Custom Components for Extreme Industrial Conditions, above a welder working inside a large pipe." width="1280" height="720" decoding="async"><span class="pj-hint" aria-hidden="true">View live</span></a><figcaption>Homepage screenshot of the live concept</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-white cs-sec" id="challenge" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Design Challenge</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="challenge-title">Industrial information needs a clearer presentation.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>Industrial material suppliers often deal with technical products, specialized applications, and buyers who need specific information before making an inquiry.</p><p data-rise>The design challenge was to create a website direction that could present this type of business without relying on a conventional corporate template.</p><p data-rise>The concept needed to balance three things:</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="cs-points"><li data-rise><h3>Product clarity</h3><p>make the materials and their industrial relevance easier to explore.</p></li><li data-rise><h3>Business credibility</h3><p>establish a professional visual direction appropriate for a B2B audience.</p></li><li data-rise><h3>Usability</h3><p>organize the experience so visitors can navigate information without unnecessary friction.</p></li></ul>
        <div class="cs-after"><p data-rise>The goal wasn’t to make the website look more complicated. It was to make the business and its offerings easier to understand.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-amber cs-sec" id="direction" aria-labelledby="direction-title">
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Visual Direction</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="direction-title">An industrial identity with a more deliberate visual system.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>The design uses a high-contrast visual language built around industrial red, dark backgrounds, and strong typography.</p><p data-rise>Rather than relying on the usual corporate blue palette and predictable service-card layouts, the direction uses bold composition and controlled spacing to give the website a more recognizable character.</p><p data-rise>Key design decisions included:</p>
            <ul class="cs-list" data-rise><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>A strong opening section that establishes the industrial positioning immediately.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Bold typography to create hierarchy and guide attention.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>High-contrast colors to reinforce the visual identity.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Structured content sections to separate business information and material-related content.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Responsive layouts to maintain readability across screen sizes.</span></li></ul>
            <p data-rise>The visual system was designed to support the subject matter, not compete with it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark cs-sec" id="development" aria-labelledby="development-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Development</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="development-title">Custom front-end work beyond a standard page layout.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>The concept was developed using custom front-end code, allowing the layout, styling, and interactions to be controlled more precisely.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="dm-rows cs-tools"><li><h3 data-rise>Custom HTML, CSS &amp; JavaScript</h3><div data-rise><p>Used to build and refine the page structure, responsive layouts, and interactive elements.</p></div></li><li><h3 data-rise>GSAP</h3><div data-rise><p>Used for motion and interface transitions that support the visual presentation.</p></div></li><li><h3 data-rise>Lenis</h3><div data-rise><p>Integrated for smooth scrolling and a more controlled scrolling experience.</p></div></li></ul>
        <div class="cs-after"><p data-rise>The animations were treated as part of the interface—not as decoration added simply to make the page move.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-white cs-sec" id="build" aria-labelledby="build-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>What Went Into the Build</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="build-title">Design decisions translated into a working website concept.</h2>
          </header>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-table" data-rise><table><caption class="sr-only">NICRO Industrial: what went into the build</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Area</th><th scope="col">Implementation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Visual design</th><td>Industrial-inspired art direction and high-contrast styling</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Content structure</th><td>Organized presentation of business and material information</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Typography</th><td>Strong hierarchy for easier content scanning</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Front-end</th><td>Custom HTML, CSS and JavaScript</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motion</th><td>GSAP-powered interface animation</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Scrolling</th><td>Lenis smooth-scroll integration</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Responsiveness</th><td>Layout adjustments for different screen sizes</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark cs-sec" id="result" aria-labelledby="result-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Result</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="result-title">A more distinctive direction for an industrial website.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>NICRO Industrial demonstrates how a specialized B2B website can move beyond a generic corporate presentation.</p><p data-rise>The concept brings together a recognizable visual direction, structured information, custom front-end development, and motion design in one responsive website experience.</p><p data-rise>It is a demonstration of my approach to building websites where the visual presentation and the underlying structure have to work together.</p>
            <p class="cs-note" data-rise><em>This is an independent website concept, not a commissioned client project. It does not represent verified business results or performance data.</em></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="cs-next" aria-label="More case studies" data-rise>
          <a href="projects.html#nicro-industrial"><span class="cs-next-k">All projects</span><span class="cs-next-t">Back to the project overview</span></a>
          <a href="case-construction-website.html"><span class="cs-next-k">Next case study</span><span class="cs-next-t">Construction Website</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-amber ab-cta" id="lets-talk" aria-labelledby="talk-title">
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-r" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ab-in">
        <h2 class="cs-cta-h" id="talk-title">Have a Website That Needs More Than a Template?</h2>
        <div class="ab-cta-body">
          <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>If your business operates in a specialized industry, your website should make your services, products, and capabilities easier to understand.</p>
          <p data-rise>I design and develop custom websites around the way your business needs to communicate.</p>
          <div class="ab-cta-actions" data-rise>
            <a class="cta cta-solid" href="https://calendly.com/-aldrichmatthew/15mins"><span>Book a Free Strategy Call</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
            <a class="cta cta-ghost" href="projects.html"><span>Explore More Projects</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  
</Base>
